\par\par \b \uc2  Credit Suisse/HK$ Overvalued -2: No Recovery For 3 Years \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 August 1998\par 08:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  "I see no recovery, at least in the next three years," Tao said. \par \par \uc2  Unemployment will climb to 7.0% this year and 9.0% next year, he said. \par \par \uc2  Removing the Hong Kong dollar from circulation and exchanging it at a fixed value for U.S. dollars is both practicable and advisable for Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  "This is probably the neatest way for Hong Kong to get out of trouble," he said. \par \par \uc2  Tao said he has presented his report to a wide range of investors in recent weeks, and "they all listened very carefully." \par \par \uc2  He said Credit Suisse First Boston is also trying to present the ideas in the report to the government, which has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in markets in recent weeks to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar peg. \par \par \uc2  He said he would hope the government would exchange Hong Kong dollars for the U.S. dollar at the current peg rate of HK$7.80 per U.S. dollar. Interest rates would fall to levels comparable to U.S. interest rates, though with a slight Hong Kong premium attached. \par \par \uc2  The idea of dollarization is that it would remove one variable and stress point slowing Hong Kong's recovery - \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk - Tao said. \par \par \uc2  With the U.S. dollar in circulation, investors and the government would only have to worry about asset values. \par \par \uc2  Tao said he would recommend a move to dollarize the economy over the next 24 months, but that any move would have to be initiated by the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Were the economy to be dollarized, the HKMA would lose much of the power it now wields, Tao noted. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 31-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0659GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8v07eqj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
