\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Up; Dlr Sales Push Rupiah To 10-Wk High \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 1998\par 11:52\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bears were forced\par to retreat Wednesday, as a steep rise in the yen combined\par with sharp stock market rallies across the region to push\par Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  higher against the U.S. dollar.\par    Japanese threats of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support\par the yen, and actual \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  government\par to shore up the Hang Seng stock index, spurred market\par participants to unwind outstanding long U.S. dollar\par positions, boosting \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  throughout the region.\par    Among the best performers was the rupiah, which rose to\par its highest level in over two months as the U.S. dollar\par dropped below the psychologically important 12,000 rupiah\par (IDR) level for the first time since early June.\par    "Now that Indonesia is rescheduling its foreign debt,\par dollar liquidity should be easier, so the state banks are\par unloading their long U.S. dollar positions," explained a\par trader at a joint venture bank in Jakarta.\par    By late in Asian trading the U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollar had dropped to\par IDR11,575, down from IDR12,563 late on Tuesday, and at its\par lowest level since June 9.\par    If short-term rupiah interest rates remain steady at\par current levels of around 70%, as the market expects they\par will, the U.S. dollar could fall as low as IDR10,000 by the\par end of next week, said the trader.\par    Late on Wednesday the three-month U.S. dollar/rupiah\par forward was trading at an implied rupiah yield of 74%, up\par from 66% the previous day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  08-19-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0552EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du8j020mq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
