f speculators and not to support the territory's flagging stock market. He added that further \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would depend on the territory's quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's view of the market. \par \par \uc2  "So a lot depends on our Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's colleagues to take a reading of the market today and take any appropriate action," Hui said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 18-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0422GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8i06z7t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
